nosaur or Powers by changing their stats and granting unique abilities based on the Element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999250/extras/430db27ed9a494de577285438bc0babf.webp?t=1757139860\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999250/extras/6324f78acb6c1b4ddf3c51414f63fcbc.poster.avif?t=1757139860\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999250/extras/6324f78acb6c1b4ddf3c51414f63fcbc.webp?t=1757139860\" class=\"bb_img\" width=875 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can fuse the various Powers together by changing their physics and stats. This way you can create custom builds without limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invade Dimensions to collect DNA, Powers and Elements. Each Dimension is different with different types of Enemies and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun experimenting and creating!</p>","developers":["ChaosPower"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3393190","name":"DinoSwarm"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999250/31904e26b095243d6229f57f681dcd62c3a38da8/header.jpg?t=1757139860","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.60 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>St